[AS2's Figure 5.24 (Difference)]

e1,d,0,v1
e2,c,0,v2
r1,d,a,r1
r3,c,b,r3
r2,a,o,r2
r4,b,0,r4
o,b,a,o

analysis: dc
note: Find vo for the general difference amplifier, symbolically. Kept for the next three entries, which are this same circuit under different conditions.
