[Bo2's Example 3.3 (Cascade)]

e,1,0,vs
r12,1,2,1/g1
r14,1,4,1/g2
r4o,4,o,1/g3
r2o,2,o,1/g4
r23,2,3,1/g
r34,3,4,1/g
o1,0,2,3
o2,0,4,o

analysis: dc
note: Two op amps in cascade: find vo in terms of the conductances and vs. It comes back (g1-g2)*vs/(g3-g4).
