[TR5's Example 4-17 (Cascade)]

r1,5,0,r1
r2,5,a,r2
r3,a,6,r3
r4,6,o,r4
e1,3,0,v1
e2,4,0,v2
o1,3,5,a
o2,4,6,o

analysis: dc
note: Derive vo in terms of v1 and v2, symbolically. Rearranged by hand, v2*(r4/r3+1) - v1*(r4/r3)*(r2/r1+1).
