units: yes


[TR5's Example 4-18 (Multiple)]

e2,a,0,v2
e1,f,0,v1
o2,a,c,b
o1,f,d,e
r1,b,c,r1
r2,c,d,r2
r3,d,e,r3

analysis: dc
note: Derive vo in terms of v1 and v2. The output is between nodes b and e, so the Evaluate line asks for vb-ve: -((r1+r2+r3)/r2)*(v1-v2).
image: https://learn.symbulator.com/assets/practice/tr5s-example-4-18-multiple-49.jpg [410px]
rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes
evaluate: vb-ve
